    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_a_04_question_04",
      "hash64": "3BCBF411B28D4FEA",
      "text": "４　想要更容易地捕捉宝可梦时，\\n　　下列哪一种方法不正确？\\n\\n・给它树果　　　　　・从背后偷袭它\\n・让它陷入中毒状态　・使用合适的球",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
